      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "李娜常常提到你，今天终于见到了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我也听她说过你。很高兴认识你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "听说你最近一直在学中文。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，现在比刚开始自然多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "你最喜欢怎么学？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听对话、走路的时候听中文，还有跟朋友聊天。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "最后一个最有用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我也越来越这么觉得。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "我平时参加一些读书和社区活动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "读书活动是大家一起聊一本书吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "有时候是，有时候只是分享最近读的东西。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这样听起来压力不大。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，新朋友来也很容易加入。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "如果下次时间合适，我想去看看。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "可以，我到时候把时间告诉你。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "谢谢。认识新朋友以后，生活真的更丰富了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LIU_MEI_001",
      "textZh": "而且会知道很多自己以前不知道的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc044_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我很期待下次活动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
